    "detailed_description": "Original: \u4e0a\u6d77\u30a2\u30ea\u30b9\u5e7b\u6a02\u56e3 - ZUN<br>Tribute: &quot;\u5c11\u5973\u7d42\u672b\u65c5\u884c&quot;<br>This is a Touhou Project secondary fan game, the setting differs from the original<br>Welcome to add our game to your wishlist! QQ exchange group: 106115456<br>(I'm using Google Translate and some expressions may be incorrect)<br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Background</h2>&quot;Renko, look! It's a city&quot; &quot;I can't see the end at a glance... Where is this place, it's a city, but it feels very desolate...&quot;<br>&quot;Hey, Renko, do you think this could be the original Gensokyo?&quot;<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612620/extras/a2cb0bbf0d5298db6d6108a659d487ad.avif?t=1695779968\" width=576 height=286 /></span><br>Renko and Merry of the Secret Sealing Club<br>Were invited to the &quot;Outer Gensokyo&quot; for a short trip<br>Outer Gensokyo (New Gensokyo) is a new Gensokyo independent of the original Gensokyo (Old Gensokyo)<br>But the original Gensokyo was destroyed for some reason<br>By chance, Renko and Merry boarded the train to the original Gensokyo<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612620/extras/70cf28b799c7639485f5e9485cd4588d.avif?t=1695779968\" width=576 height=324 /></span><br>They didn't know that what awaited them was a huge tomb of the steel forest<br>And a sudden train accident trapped the two in Gensokyo<br>In order to find her missing friend Merry, Renko began a new journey in the icy Gensokyo<br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>Gensokyo is no longer a paradise, struggle to survive in this cruel world<br><br>The biting cold will kill you, if you don't have energy, you will fall in the snow<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612620/extras/c3b431ba239a68d04dbb7a5dbc1bdee4.avif?t=1695779968\" width=576 height=324 /></span><br>Scavenge for supplies, light a campfire, cook food<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612620/extras/293f1bb8f714fb2dab03caa8b91f7250.avif?t=1695779968\" width=576 height=324 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612620/extras/757345bef0f4a3baa7073cb1557f1b69.avif?t=1695779968\" width=576 height=324 /></span><br>Danger not only comes from the cold weather, you will encounter strange and terrifying enemies<br>Hungry wolves, terrifying killing machines...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612620/extras/ca5d9fa7dd8f412cc682b33528d076d7.avif?t=1695779968\" width=576 height=324 /></span><br>Why has it become like this? Why do these machines attack humans?<br>Find guns, protect yourself!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612620/extras/d1bda90902e60a04a3905c34fad64063.avif?t=1695779968\" width=576 height=324 /></span><br>Craft items, modify guns to better deal with various situations<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612620/extras/c0fe3ebd2d4c4c43d730b2ab4df047ca.avif?t=1695779968\" width=576 height=324 /></span><br>Hunt, find more food and supplies<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612620/extras/8e608f876c4986f429063fbf5f9c6e5a.avif?t=1695779968\" width=576 height=324 /></span><br>Complete difficult tasks, face powerful enemies, fight alongside teammates<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612620/extras/8616cab8f56541d9d0c1e9af87206658.avif?t=1695779968\" width=576 height=324 /></span><br>Find lost friends, meet other survivors, strive to survive<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612620/extras/c075252a08ae0c3138978433d466b511.avif?t=1695779968\" width=576 height=298 /></span><br>&quot;Merry, I will definitely find you...&quot;<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612620/extras/39d942a75b97a0461367de47efbbfa72.avif?t=1695779968\" width=576 height=324 /></span><br>&quot;No matter how far, no matter how dangerous, I will definitely...&quot;<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612620/extras/957342c9fe0dfe8f8858e1c066690dcd.avif?t=1695779968\" width=576 height=324 /></span><br>Uncover the truth behind the world's destruction, find hope for the survival of the end of the world<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612620/extras/67ad9f6e89ec1913227f31a66b8eb6de.avif?t=1695779968\" width=384 height=186 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612620/extras/9b3aee77765dc2d371d942adda620afa.avif?t=1695779968\" width=630 height=302 /></span><br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A few words from the developer</h2>Hello everyone! This is Crow Crow Island! We are the production team of this game! Our team currently only has two crows (people)<br>We are \u2468\u51bb\u591c\u96c0\u820c and \u963f\u9e26 (me), I am responsible for the main content of this game (program, art ,music), \u96c0\u820c helps me with music and art<br>The game trial and distribution are free, only the game's original soundtrack (Game original Soundtrack) is an optional dlc charge<br>The game pays tribute to tkmiz sensei's &quot;\u5c11\u5973\u7d42\u672b\u65c5\u884c&quot;, and has received tkmiz sensei's approval~<br>I have added many related elements, I hope friends who like Touhou and \u5c11\u5973\u7d42\u672b\u65c5\u884c like my game<br>We are looking for a translation team, need Japanese and English direction translation,<br>Because the game itself is free, so I'm sorry I can't provide funds for friends who help translate;<br>But I will still send a small gift as a thank you, so friends who are interested are welcome to contact me~",
